        },
        {
          "text": "Elia dok te kobbi Erica ni, “Tim ber koŋ ibed kan; pien Rwot okobo ni an koŋ awot i Jeriko.” Ento Erica te gamo ni, “Kite acalo Rwot tye kwo-ni, dok yin daŋ itye kwo-ni, an gira mom abino pokere kedi.” Gin luŋ doŋ ote wot naka i Jeriko.",
          "type": "text",
